# Average Selling Price

## Problem Summary
Write a query to calculate the average selling price of each product based on the units sold during its applicable price period, rounded to two decimal places.

## Solution

```sql
SELECT p.product_id, ROUND( IFNULL(SUM(p.price * u.units) / SUM(u.units), 0), 2) AS average_price FROM Prices p
LEFT JOIN UnitsSold u ON p.product_id = u.product_id AND u.purchase_date BETWEEN p.start_date AND p.end_date
GROUP BY p.product_id;
```
